        "heading_CCpKnk": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SPECIAL PROJECT “Sensitivity & Sensuality” — a series of conversations with women who deeply feel the world and themselves within it."
          }
        },
        "richtext_wPMyPg": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We live in a time of urgency — of constant replies, resilience, and restraint. We’re expected to stay composed, stay strong, stay functional. But in this daily marathon of productivity, the most precious thing is not to lose ourselves.</p><p>This project is not about beauty in the conventional sense. It’s a manifesto of a new kind of balance. It’s about beauty in the details — in the honesty of being with your skin, your rhythm, your own sense of self.</p><p>Each woman featured is a reflection of this wholeness. They don’t play roles. Each one holds her own ritual of silence, her lived experience, her scars — and her beauty. They live as they feel.<br/>And that’s exactly what makes them inspiring.</p>",
            "text_size": 14
          }
        }
      },
