    "accordion_9iFDNN": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_content_wwCEyY": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Sensitivity ≠ Weakness",
            "text": "<p><strong>Sensitivity isn’t about being overly fragile.</strong><br/>It’s about the ability to respond to the world.<br/>It’s about depth.</p><p>Our skin is our armour, our adornment, our memory.<br/>It remembers cold and sunlight, embraces and stress.<br/>It lives — with us.<br/>And when it’s sensitive, it’s not a flaw.<br/>It’s a mirror of our rhythm, our experience.<br/>Each day, we learn not to silence sensitivity,<br/>but to transform it into a resource.</p><p><strong>Sensuality is its continuation.</strong><br/>It’s what makes us feel alive.<br/>And it’s not only about skin —<br/>It’s about the ability to feel the world:<br/>textures, emotions, people, moments.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_nnxK8V": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "To be strong is to be alive.To be alive is to feel.",
            "text": "<p>And it is this very ability — to feel with our skin, our heart, our nerve endings —<br/>that doesn’t just preserve our youth.<br/>It preserves life within us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_biPxRy": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Re[Sens] was born from the belief that sensitivity is not a flaw — it’s a resource.",
            "text": "<p>We work in the field of neurocosmetics, exploring the connection between emotional states and skin responses.<br/>By combining immuno-, neuro-, and sensi-cosmetology, we create formulas that don’t suppress the skin — they understand it.</p><p>These are advanced biotechnologies designed to support the skin’s natural mechanisms of regeneration and resilience, with deep respect for the microbiome and individuality.</p><p>We believe: sensitivity is not just about the body — it’s about how we interact with the world around us.<br/>That’s why going plastic-free is not a marketing strategy for us — it’s a conscious choice.</p><p>We implement sustainable solutions: biomaterials that are kind to the planet — mycelium, wood, aluminium, recycled paper, fallen leaves, and more.<br/>No, it’s not perfect yet.<br/>But we are moving — honestly and intentionally — toward packaging that leaves no trace behind.</p><p>Because caring for your skin and caring for the planet are two parts of the same whole.</p><p>We reduce sensitivity without dulling sensuality.<br/>But this project is not about cosmetics.<br/>It’s about us.</p><p>And we hope it becomes a reminder for you too:</p><p><strong>Sensitivity is not weakness.<br/>Softness is not surrender.<br/>Sensuality is the path back to your true self.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
